{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログをこれからどうするか\n皆さんのコメントや私の考えとして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前みたいに1ヶ月に3回とかにはならないようにして\n自分のペースで続けていこうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/12/1933185/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんはいい匂い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うなじがいい匂い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな匂い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着く匂い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/12/1933185/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運命共同体です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/12/1933185/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ。。まいちゅん。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/12/1933185/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しみを乗り越えたら\n人は成長する。とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもちゃんと意味があって\nしろみ、きみがこのタイミングに亡くなったのも何か意味がある。とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は辛いけど、時間が経てば\n辛くなくなる。とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はそうは思いません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、これからもずっと悲しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までもこれからもずっとずっと\nしろみもきみも家族だからだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、悲しいの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族なんだもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、しろみにもきみにも\n感謝してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かが亡くなって\nこんなに泣いたこと今までにないし\nこんなに悲しいこともない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに好きでいさせてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今もずっとだいすきだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/12/1933185/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろみちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/12/1933185/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きみちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、また！"}],"source":"archive